#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FacebookPublishingAuthenticator.vala:166
msgid ""
"You are not currently logged into Facebook.\n"
"\n"
"If you don’t yet have a Facebook account, you can create one during the "
"login process. During login, Shotwell Connect may ask you for permission to "
"upload photos and publish to your feed. These permissions are required for "
"Shotwell Connect to function."
msgstr ""
"U is nie  by Facebook aangemeld nie.\n"
"\n"
"As u nog nie 'n Facebook-rekening het nie, kan u een tydens die "
"aanmeldproses skep. Tydens aanmelding kan Shotwell Connect u toestemming vra "
"om foto's op te laai en op u feed te publiseer. Hierdie regte is nodig vir "
"Shotwell Connect om te funksioneer."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FacebookPublishingAuthenticator.vala:168
msgid ""
"You have already logged in and out of Facebook during this Shotwell "
"session.\n"
"To continue publishing to Facebook, quit and restart Shotwell, then try "
"publishing again."
msgstr ""
"Jy het reeds in en uit geteken na Facebook tydens hierdie Shotwell sessie. "
"Om voort te gaan met die publikasie na Facebook af te sluit en weer Shotwell "
"te begin, probeer om dan weer te publiseer."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FlickrPublishingAuthenticator.vala:17
msgid ""
"You are not currently logged into Flickr.\n"
"\n"
"Click Log in to log into Flickr in your Web browser. You will have to "
"authorize Shotwell Connect to link to your Flickr account."
msgstr ""
"U is nie by Flickr aangemeld nie.\n"
"\n"
"Klik op Log in om aan te meld by Flickr in u webblaaier. U moet Shotwell "
"Connect magtig om na u Flickr-rekening te skakel."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FlickrPublishingAuthenticator.vala:148
msgid "Preparing for login…"
msgstr "Berei voor vir aanmelding ..."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FlickrPublishingAuthenticator.vala:203
msgid "Flickr authorization failed"
msgstr "Flickr magtiging het misluk"

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/FlickrPublishingAuthenticator.vala:210
msgid "Verifying authorization…"
msgstr "Verifieer magtiging ..."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/GoogleAuthenticator.vala:173
msgid ""
"You have already logged in and out of a Google service during this Shotwell "
"session.\n"
"\n"
"To continue publishing to Google services, quit and restart Shotwell, then "
"try publishing again."
msgstr ""
"Jy het reeds in- en uitgeteken van 'n Google-diens profiel gedurende hierdie "
"Shotwell sessie.\n"
"\n"
"Om voort te gaan om jou leêr te publiseer na Google dienste,  maak toe en "
"heropen Shotwell en probeer dan weer."

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/ShotwellAuthenticatorFactory.vala:30
msgid ""
"You are not currently logged into YouTube.\n"
"\n"
"You must have already signed up for a Google account and set it up for use "
"with YouTube to continue. You can set up most accounts by using your browser "
"to log into the YouTube site at least once.\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell uses the YouTube API services <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/youtube\">https://developers.google.com/"
"youtube</a> for accessing your YouTube channel and upload the videos. By "
"using Shotwell to access YouTube, you agree to be bound to the YouTube Terms "
"of Service as available at <a "
"href=\"https://www.youtube.com/t/terms\">https://www.youtube.com/t/terms</a>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell's privacy policy regarding the use of data related to your Google "
"account in general and YouTube in particular can be found in our <a "
"href=\"help:shotwell/privacy-policy\">online services privacy policy</a>\n"
"\n"
"For Google's own privacy policy, please refer to <a "
"href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/priv"
"acy</a>"
msgstr ""
"You are not currently logged into YouTube.\n"
"\n"
"Jy moet reeds vir 'n Google-rekening aangemeld het en dit opstel om met "
"YouTube te gebruik. Jy kan die meeste rekeninge opstel deur jou blaaier te "
"gebruik om ten minste een keer op die YouTube-webwerf aan te meld.\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell gebruik die YouTube API dienste <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/youtube\">https://developers.google.com/"
"youtube</a> vir toegang tot u YouTube-kanaal en die video's op te laai. Deur "
"Shotwell te gebruik om toegang tot YouTube te verkry, stem u in tot die "
"YouTube-diensbepalings soos beskikbaar by <a "
"href=\"https://www.youtube.com/t/terms\">https://www.youtube.com/t/terms</a>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell se privaatheidsbeleid rakende die gebruik van data wat verband hou "
"met jou Google-rekening in die algemeen en YouTube in die besonder, kan "
"gevind word in ons <a href=\"help:shotwell/privacy-policy\">online services "
"privacy policy</a>\n"
"\n"
"Vir Google se eie privaatheidsbeleid, verwys asseblief na <a "
"href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/priv"
"acy</a>"

#: plugins/authenticator/shotwell/ShotwellAuthenticatorFactory.vala:36
msgid ""
"You are not currently logged into Google Photos.\n"
"\n"
"You must have already signed up for a Google account and set it up for use "
"with Google Photos. Shotwell uses the Google Photos API services <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/photos/\">https://developers.google.com/"
"photos/</a> for all interaction with your Google Photos data.You will have "
"to grant access Shotwell to your Google Photos library.\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell's privacy policy regarding the use of data related to your Google "
"account in general and Google Photos in particular can be found in our <a "
"href=\"help:shotwell/privacy-policy\">online services privacy policy</a>For "
"Google's own privacy policy, please refer to <a "
"href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/priv"
"acy</a>"
msgstr ""
"Jy is nie tans by Google Foto's aangemeld nie.\n"
"\n"
"Jy moet reeds vir 'n Google-rekening aangemeld het en dit opstel vir gebruik "
"met Google Foto's. Shotwell gebruik die Google Photos API dienste <a "
"href=\"https://developers.google.com/photos/\">https://developers.google.com/"
"photos/</a> vir alle interaksie met jou Google Foto's-data. Jy moet Shotwell "
"toegang tot jou Google Foto's-biblioteek verleen.\n"
"\n"
"Shotwell se privaatheidsbeleid rakende die gebruik van data wat verband hou "
"met jou Google rekening in die algemeen en Google Foto's in die besonder, "
"kan gevind word in ons <a href=\"help:shotwell/privacy-policy\">online "
"services privacy policy</a>Vir Google se eie privaatheidsbeleid, verwys "
"asseblief na <a "
"href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">https://policies.google.com/priv"
"acy</a>"

